{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"mcp__figma__get_metadata_1_12f922dc","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"1:3\" name=\"02 · Components 组件库\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"1:24\" name=\"Components\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1400\" height=\"478\">\n    <text id=\"1:25\" name=\"Components · Meet (default states only)\" x=\"56\" y=\"48\" width=\"631\" height=\"39\" />\n    <text id=\"1:26\" name=\"Only a default Button and the platform shell are given (no text input appears in this task, so there is no Text Field). Every other state (pressed, selected, followed, liked, disabled…), the headers, the tab bar, the tabs and every business component (story avatars, feed posts, swipe cards, action buttons, profile header, media grid, short-video overlay, sign-in sheet, menu rows…) are part of the assignment — build them as reusable components in your own file.\" x=\"56\" y=\"107\" width=\"1288\" height=\"57\" />\n    <text id=\"1:27\" name=\"Button · default\" x=\"56\" y=\"184\" width=\"134\" height=\"22\" />\n    <symbol id=\"1:28\" name=\"Button\" x=\"56\" y=\"226\" width=\"345\" height=\"52\" />\n    <text id=\"1:30\" name=\"Platform shell · system UI (not evaluated)\" x=\"56\" y=\"298\" width=\"358\" height=\"22\" />\n    <text id=\"1:31\" name=\"iOS status bar (with Dynamic Island) and home indicator, 393 wide, transparent background. Place them on every frame; they are not part of your design (recolor the glyphs to white on dark photos if needed).\" x=\"56\" y=\"340\" width=\"1288\" height=\"16\" />\n    <frame id=\"1:32\" name=\"Shell\" x=\"56\" y=\"376\" width=\"834\" height=\"54\">\n      <symbol id=\"1:33\" name=\"Status Bar\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"393\" height=\"54\" />\n      <symbol id=\"1:44\" name=\"Home Indicator\" x=\"441\" y=\"0\" width=\"393\" height=\"34\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST